          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">
While every model in the same unit in the Regiment of Renown is contesting the same objective, add 1 to save rolls and ward rolls for that unit.              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="d1f3-921c-b403-1106" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="lessThan" value="1"/>
